 <section class="work-title scene" id="work" data-scene="work-title" aria-labelledby="work-title-heading"><div class="sticky-stage work-title-stage"><div class="planet" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="work-title-copy"><p class="kicker">SELECTED WORK</p><h2 id="work-title-heading">Work you can<br><em>inspect.</em></h2><p>Public source, tests, and failure paths.</p></div><div class="work-transition-label" aria-hidden="true">02 FLAGSHIP SYSTEMS</div><div class="scene-index" aria-hidden="true">03</div></div></section><section class="project-scene scene" data-project="1" aria-labelledby="agent-heading" aria-describedby="agent-limits"><div class="sticky-stage project-stage"><div class="project-copy"><div class="project-count">01 / 02 · PYTHON / FASTAPI</div><h2 id="agent-heading">Bounded Agent Runtime</h2><p>What if an external action succeeds, then its worker crashes? This runtime records intent first and reconciles uncertain outcomes instead of blindly retrying.</p><p class="result">261 tests · 90.01% coverage — preserved v2</p><a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/agent-runtime-python" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inspect the source →</a></div><div class="project-device" role="group" aria-label="Simplified Agent Runtime architecture diagram"><div class="device-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>ARCHITECTURE / AGENT RUNTIME</b></div><div class="device-body" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable architecture details"><div class="arch-label"><span>EXPLICIT EXECUTION STATE</span><span>SIMPLIFIED SYSTEM MODEL</span></div><div class="flow-graph"><div class="flow-node"><span>01 / ADMISSION</span><strong>Validate</strong><small>tenant + request</small></div><div class="flow-node"><span>02 / CONTROL</span><strong>Approve</strong><small>persistent decision</small></div><div class="flow-node active"><span>03 / WRITE</span><strong>Persist intent</strong><small>before external I/O</small></div><div class="flow-node warn"><span>04 / RECOVER</span><strong>Reconcile</strong><small>uncertain outcome</small></div></div><div class="flow-note"><b>Timeout ≠ failure.</b><span>Avoid repeating a possible external side effect.</span></div><div class="flow-meta"><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Worker fencing</span><span>Idempotency</span><span>Human approval</span><span>Crash tests</span></div></div></div><div class="project-stack">API · STATE · RECOVERY</div><div class="scene-index" aria-hidden="true">04</div></div></section><section class="project-scene scene" data-project="2" aria-labelledby="knowledge-heading" aria-describedby="knowledge-limits"><div class="sticky-stage project-stage"><div class="project-copy"><div class="project-count">02 / 02 · FASTAPI / PGVECTOR / MCP</div><h2 id="knowledge-heading">Knowledge Workflow Runtime</h2><p>Documents change. Tools need boundaries. This runtime tracks source versions, provides cited retrieval, and holds uncertain extractions for review.</p><p class="result">134 tests · 91.64% coverage · 12/12 evals</p><a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/varevant.com/tree/main/examples/agentic-systems-lab/knowledge-runtime" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Inspect the source →</a></div><div class="project-device" role="group" aria-label="Simplified Knowledge Workflow Runtime architecture diagram"><div class="device-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>ARCHITECTURE / KNOWLEDGE RUNTIME</b></div><div class="device-body" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable architecture details"><div class="arch-label"><span>SOURCE LIFECYCLE</span><span>SIMPLIFIED SYSTEM MODEL</span></div><div class="flow-graph"><div class="flow-node"><span>01 / SOURCE</span><strong>Ingest</strong><small>PDF · image · DOCX</small></div><div class="flow-node"><span>02 / STATE</span><strong>Version</strong><small>atomic updates + deletes</small></div><div class="flow-node active"><span>03 / RETRIEVAL</span><strong>Retrieve</strong><small>current source citations</small></div><div class="flow-node warn"><span>04 / AUTHORITY</span><strong>Review</strong><small>MCP + human approval</small></div></div><div class="flow-note"><b>Stale data stays out.</b><span>Current citations and review before handoff.</span></div><div class="flow-meta"><span>PostgreSQL / pgvector</span><span>Native MCP</span><span>OCR</span><span>Source tombstones</span></div></div></div><div class="project-stack">RETRIEVAL · DATA · AUTHORITY</div><div class="scene-index" aria-hidden="true">05</div></div></section><p class="sr-only" id="agent-limits">Independent tested reference. Results are archived v2 evidence, not current commercial use or universal exactly-once delivery.</p><p class="sr-only" id="knowledge-limits">Default retrieval uses deterministic lexical embeddings and extractive answers. Twelve synthetic regression cases do not establish commercial semantic retrieval quality.</p><p class="proof-note">These are <b>tested engineering references</b>, not claims of live customer scale or uptime. Test figures describe the linked revisions. <a href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/agent-runtime-python/tree/f292f3cdb5d6daf5650e495898dbe8f8a710ea75/evidence/v2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agent evidence</a> · <a href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/varevant.com/blob/829711f66a3b65f7d8e819a6c3144b7f2d044a57/examples/agentic-systems-lab/knowledge-runtime/docs/verification.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Knowledge verification</a></p>
 <section class="other-work section-pad" aria-labelledby="other-title"><div class="content-width"><div class="section-head reveal"><p class="kicker">ALSO BUILT</p><h2 id="other-title">More engineering<br>work.</h2></div><div class="other-grid"><article class="other-card reveal"><div><p class="kicker">TYPESCRIPT / POSTGRESQL</p><h3>Production Integration Reference</h3><p>Signed webhook intake, atomic reservation, bounded retries, and recovery-aware outcome handling.</p><div class="compact-proof">Runnable reference · tests · CI</div></div><a href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/production-integration-reference" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View code →</a></article><article class="other-card reveal"><div><p class="kicker">N8N / JAVASCRIPT</p><h3>VAREVANT Workflow Engineering</h3><p>Historical workflow source with suppression, state checks, no-send paths, and recorded recovery work.</p><div class="compact-proof">117-node historical graph · 60 Code nodes</div></div><a href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/varevant.com/tree/main/n8n" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View evidence →</a></article></div><p class="minor-project">Also: <a href="https://github.com/naraya07pedro-spec/bimmca-intelligence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BIMMCA Intelligence ↗</a> — Supabase browser consumer.</p></div></section>
